
variable totLength equal 10
variable dispDist equal "v_totLength * v_dispRatio / 2"

variable seed equal 1
units real
boundary p p p

atom_style molecular

region main block -500 500 -500 500 -500 500

create_box 21 main bond/types 20 angle/types 19 extra/bond/per/atom 2 extra/angle/per/atom 3 extra/special/per/atom 6
Created orthogonal box = (-500 -500 -500) to (500 500 500)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid

molecule WLC_21 Structures/Production/relaxed_WLC_21.txt
Read molecule template WLC_21:
# Relaxed Production Model for Worm-Like Chain
  1 molecules
  0 fragments
  21 atoms with max type 21
  20 bonds with max type 20
  19 angles with max type 19
  0 dihedrals with max type 0
  0 impropers with max type 0
bond_style harmonic
angle_style harmonic
dihedral_style none

create_atoms 0 single 0 0 0 mol WLC_21 ${seed} rotate 0 0 0 1
create_atoms 0 single 0 0 0 mol WLC_21 1 rotate 0 0 0 1
Created 21 atoms
  using lattice units in orthogonal box = (-500 -500 -500) to (500 500 500)
  create_atoms CPU = 0.005 seconds

read_data Structures/Coeffs/coeffs_WLC_21.data add merge
Reading data file ...
  orthogonal box = (-500 -500 -500) to (500 500 500)
  1 by 1 by 1 MPI processor grid
Finding 1-2 1-3 1-4 neighbors ...
  special bond factors lj:    0        0        0       
  special bond factors coul:  0        0        0       
     3 = max # of 1-2 neighbors
     6 = max # of 1-3 neighbors
    18 = max # of 1-4 neighbors
    13 = max # of special neighbors
  special bonds CPU = 0.000 seconds
  read_data CPU = 0.006 seconds
bond_coeff * 0 1

group internals type 2:20
19 atoms in group internals
group endpointAlpha type 1
1 atoms in group endpointAlpha
group endpointOmega type 21
1 atoms in group endpointOmega
group endpoints subtract all internals
2 atoms in group endpoints

displace_atoms endpointAlpha move 0 ${dispDist} 0 units box
displace_atoms endpointAlpha move 0 1 0 units box
Displacing atoms ...
displace_atoms endpointOmega move 0 -${dispDist} 0 units box
displace_atoms endpointOmega move 0 -1 0 units box
Displacing atoms ...

variable k_restrain equal 200

fix restraint all arclengthrestraint WLC_21 ${k_restrain} ${totLength}
fix restraint all arclengthrestraint WLC_21 200 ${totLength}
fix restraint all arclengthrestraint WLC_21 200 10
fix_modify restraint energy yes

comm_modify cutoff 100

compute internalsTemp internals temp
thermo_style custom step pe ke fnorm epair epair ebond eangle edihed etotal

fix stationary endpoints setforce 0 0 0
min_modify dmax 10 norm max line backtrack # backtrack is necessary because minimizing points of restraint energy are degenerate
minimize 0 0 100000 100000
Neighbor list info ...
  update: every = 1 steps, delay = 0 steps, check = yes
  max neighbors/atom: 2000, page size: 100000
  master list distance cutoff = 0
  ghost atom cutoff = 100
  binsize = 1000, bins = 1 1 1
  1 neighbor lists, perpetual/occasional/extra = 1 0 0
  (1) fix arclengthrestraint, perpetual
      attributes: half, newton on
      pair build: half/bin/newton
      stencil: half/bin/3d
      bin: standard
WARNING: No pairwise cutoff or binsize set. Atom sorting therefore disabled. (../atom.cpp:2442)
